{"path":"locale/locale/operator_cmp","title":"std::locale::operator==, operator!=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::locale::</span>operator==, operator!=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/locale/operator_cmp","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"Tests two locales for equality. Named locales are considered equal if their names are equal. Unnamed locales are considered equal if they are copies of each other.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> locale<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> locale<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(until C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Tests two locales for equality. Named locales are considered equal if their names are equal. Unnamed locales are considered equal if they are copies of each other. \n</p>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx20\"><td>\n<p>The <code>!=</code> operator is <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/default_comparisons#Other_defaulted_comparison_operators\">synthesized</a> from <code>operator==</code>.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\">std::locale</a></span> object to compare\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> is a copy of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> or has an identical name, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> is a copy of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> or has an identical name, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> otherwise.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/locale\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a new locale <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/name\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>name</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the name of the locale or <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\"*\"</span></span> if unnamed <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"},{"path":"locale/locale","title":"std::locale"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::locale::operator==, operator!=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: until C++20. Tests two locales for equality. Named locales are considered equal if their names are equal."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if other is a copy of *this or has an identical name, false otherwise."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs a new locale"},{"label":"name","note":"returns the name of the locale or \"*\" if unnamed"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":127,"codeBlockCount":0}
